# TEST split. Authored BEFORE the engine was ever run on it; frozen with a SHA-256 manifest (data/eval/MANIFEST.json); run once for the official
# held-out number (see reports/heldout_log.md).  Gold edits after observing results are forbidden (reports/gold_changes.md must stay empty for this split).
# Format: ID | category | text | gold
