# ------------------------------------------------------------------ multi-turn: pronouns, back-references, corrections, artifacts, memory (U: user, A: assistant; gold applies to the last turn)
T130 | discourse | U: Let's talk about Marrow Systems. // U: Who founded it? | rel=founder; from=Marrow Systems; ref=it>Marrow Systems; unres=0
T131 | discourse | U: Who founded it? | rel=founder; ref=it>unresolved; dep=ambiguous_missing_context; unres=1
T132 | discourse | U: I'm looking at Lumora Networks, a telecom business. // U: Weather is nice. // U: Which company acquired the business I mentioned earlier? | rel=acquirer; from=Lumora Networks; ref=the business I mentioned earlier>Lumora Networks; unres=0
T133 | discourse | U: Use the 2021 dataset. // U: Actually, use the 2024 dataset from now on. // U: Who founded Oakhaven Partners? | active=dataset:2024; inactive=dataset:2021; sel=+2024 dataset,-2021 dataset
T134 | discourse | A: Two options: // A: Option 1: Use a queue. // A: Option 2: Use a lock. // U: Why did the second option fail? | ref=the second option>Option 2; unres=0
T135 | discourse | U: Why did the third option fail? | ref=the third option>unresolved; unres=1
T136 | discourse | U: Compare Pyrrhic Software and Lumora Networks. // U: Which one is bigger? | intent=comparison; ref=Which one is bigger?>resolved; unres=0
T137 | discourse | U: Tell me about Mercury. // U: What is its atomic number? | rel=atomic_number; ref=its>unresolved
T138 | discourse | U: We are studying planets. // U: Tell me about Mercury. | subject=Mercury:planet:planet.mercury; amb=resolved
T139 | discourse | U: Do not include agencies. // U: Find organizations in Spain. | intent=search; sel=+agencies
T140 | discourse | U: Never mind the earlier instruction. // U: Who founded Marrow Systems? | rel=founder; from=Marrow Systems
T141 | discourse | U: We decided to use SQLite for the billing service. // U: What did we decide about the billing service? | intent=conversation_recall; sel=+SQLite
